  "proof": "Let D be diagonal with entries 41 on the 21 second-moment coordinates and 533 on the 1,440 fourth-order orbit coordinates. The exact rationalized dual y is normalized so ||D^{-1}y||_1=1. Arb certifies y^T(b-a_j)>1/5 for every one of the 6,137 listed physical columns. Hence every probability mixture p on this exact finite pool obeys y^T(b-Ap)>1/5. Since ||y||_1<=533, Holder gives ||b-Ap||_infinity>1/2665. Each retained moment coordinate is a bounded orbit-character expectation, so the program-mass TV distance is >1/5330.",
  "quartet_count": 111930,
